+| Concurrency policy | Whole-visit revisions: complete-visit submissions, base revision IDs, competing revisions resolved by coordinators | Field-aware three-way merge (auto-combine disjoint field edits, review overlaps) | Merge rules can combine scientifically related edits (a species identification and its cover estimate) without noticing. A larger review queue is accepted as the price of keeping every submitted visit intact as a unit and requiring no maintained merge logic. Full tradeoff analysis: decisions/whole-visit-revisions-vs-three-way-merge.md |
